-¿Dónde está Tabitha?

267
00:14:29,703 --> 00:14:30,662
-¿Tabitha?
-¿Dónde está?

268
00:14:30,787 --> 00:14:31,830
-Ted.
-¡Tío Ted!

269
00:14:31,955 --> 00:14:33,582
